	(text "OpenLogicEFI ECU's are designed for use with Speeduino firmware.\n - https://github.com/noisymime/speeduino\n\nBoard Selection in tuner studio for this ECU is \"Speeduino v0.4\"\n\nOpenLogicEFI GitHub - https://github.com/OpenLogicEFI\n\nSpeeduino Official GitHub - https://github.com/noisymime/speeduino\n\nPlease consider sponsoring Speeduino and Josh on github\nso he can advance his efforts.\nhttps://github.com/sponsors/noisymime"
